WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.730
Have you ever wondered what&nbsp;
an ordinary hamster might&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.370
dream of? What kind of life it wants for itself?

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:12.690
SCP Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire&nbsp;
Camera, to snap a picture of Charles, an ordinary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:17.490
golden hamster, while he was being held in&nbsp;
Dr. Fisher's left hand. This was the result:

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:21.930
"The hamster is sleeping in a cage. Dr.&nbsp;
Fisher's hand is nowhere to be seen."

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:26.130
All Charles wanted was to be left&nbsp;
alone, so he could have a nap.

